t is supported by this source path. This deny conclusion is supported at the declared-entry boundary; the boundary does not establish the implementation details of PaperlessNotePermissions or any behavior outside the supplied ranges.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry-notes-post","kind":"entry","statement":"The notes action accepts POST and is the assessed handler entry.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1841,"endLine":1848}]},{"id":"f-global-permission-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The notes action is bound to PaperlessNotePermissions as its permission class.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1841,"endLine":1845}]},{"id":"f-view-control","kind":"control","statement":"Before method dispatch, the handler applies an owner-aware view_document check to the loaded document and returns forbidden if it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1851,"endLine":1862}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware-definition","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware check succeeds when the object has no owner, the owner equals the caller, or the object permission checker grants the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9568837fbfe275f5","startLine":624,"endLine":637}]},{"id":"f-change-control","kind":"control","statement":"The POST branch applies an owner-aware change_document check to the target document and returns forbidden when it fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1877,"endLine":1886}]},{"id":"f-note-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The note is created only at the subsequent Note.objects.create call, using the target document, request note data, and current user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-326d35bf1de38682","startLine":1888,"endLine":1892}]},{"id":"f-change-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the stated premises, the different owner and absent object change_document grant make the owner-aware change_document condition false.","citations":[{"sour